  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_9345.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">129 fotos del &#39;flashmob&#39;, o baile masivo arm&oacute;nico, organizado por el Centro Autorizado de Danza de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda, en el Raval de Sant Josep, con motivo del D&iacute;a Internacional de la Danza. Ha colaborado el &aacute;rea de Cultura del Ayuntamiento de Onda. La profesora del centro Teresa Buend&iacute;a ha le&iacute;do el manifiesto.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flashmobdiainternacionaldanca14/img_9322.jpg\" alt=\"img_9322\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flashmobdiainternacionaldanca14/img_9323.jpg\" alt=\"img_9323\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flashmobdiainternacionaldanca14/img_9324.jpg\" alt=\"img_9324\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flashmobdiainternacionaldanca14/img_9325.jpg\" alt=\"img_9325\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flashmobdiainternacionaldanca14/img_9326.jpg\" alt=\"img_9326\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flashmobdiainternacionaldanca14/img_9327.jpg\" alt=\"img_9327\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flashmobdiainternacionaldanca14/img_9328.jpg\" alt=\"img_9328\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/flashmobdiainternacionaldan